    <!-- ==================== TÉRMINOS Y CONDICIONES ==================== -->
    <string name="terms_PreuSync">
To use **PreuSync**, you must accept the following conditions:\n\n
1. **License and Use**\n
PreuSync is free software. Monetization of any content generated or obtained through this platform is prohibited.\n\n
2. **Truthfulness of Information**\n
Data provided during registration must be truthful. If false information is detected, your account and associated device may be suspended temporarily or permanently, depending on the severity of the infringement.\n\n
3. **Permitted Content**\n
Only content related to the educational community (students, teachers or institutions) of our country is allowed, whether directly or indirectly.\n\n
4. **Prohibitions**\n
The following is strictly prohibited:\n
- Posting discriminatory content (based on race, gender, religion, ideology, etc.).\n
- Distributing SPAM or unsolicited material.\n
- Sharing content restricted to over 18 years of age or infringing third-party rights.\n\n
5. **Student Accounts**\n
Minors must have the express authorization of their legal guardians to register. Otherwise, the account will be deleted without prior notice.
    </string>

